{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-address-grand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"address-grand-nshama-downtown-dubai","about":"Address Grand Downtown by Nshama is an epitome of elegance in Downtown Dubai, offering exquisite 3 to 5-bedroom apartments and duplexes. This prestigious 55-story residential tower features 80 exclusive residences, designed for those who value sophistication and prime location. The Address Grand Downtown offers unparalleled views: one side frames the Burj Khalifa and Downtown Dubai, while the other provides serene sea views, blending vibrant energy with tranquil escape. Its tiered design creates dynamic contours, making it a standout in Dubai’s skyline. Every residence is crafted as a private sanctuary with expansive ceilings, retractable glass walls, and seamless indoor-outdoor integration. Thoughtful layouts, premium materials, and impeccable design enhance luxury living. Interiors reflect refined minimalism with custom furnishings, intricate detailing, and an exclusive retreat ambiance.Luxury extends to marble flooring, built-in wood veneer cabinets, lavish wardrobes, and spa-like bathrooms with soaking tubs and floor-to-ceiling windows. Functional kitchens feature quartz countertops and premium appliances. From an infinity pool to a state-of-the-art fitness center, every detail caters to discerning residents. Address Grand Downtown is not just a home—it’s an investment in exclusivity and timeless elegance in Dubai’s most sought-after destination.","price":10860000,"title":"Address Grand","bitrix":{"id":1134,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Address Grand Downtown","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Address Grand Downtown","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Nshama","project_location":"Downtown Dubai"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feat_af547ef888.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cl